tyle=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">수록분이 포함되어 있어야 함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">학위논문관련양식은 본교 대학원별 홈페이지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">-</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">논문안내에서 확인가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">제출방법 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">메일제출</span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(mintsaw@kumoh.ac.kr)</span></u></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 바탕; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">위의 제출서류 파일명은 학번성명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.hwp</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">파일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(ex: 20134123</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">홍길동</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.hwp)</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">로 제출</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 바탕; font-size: 12pt;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]--><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">※ </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">메일 제출 후 대학원 검증 받은</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-family: 한컴돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">메일답장</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-family: 한컴돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) </span