><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">최종본은 결과보고서의 제목과 반드시 동일하여야 하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">본인의 대학원명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">이름</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">심사위원 등을 반드시 확인하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 한컴돋움; font-size: 12pt;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]--><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 한컴돋움; font-size: 12pt;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]--><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; 